            "These agents often leverage open-weight models.",
            "They serve as an alternative to proprietary cloud-based subscriptions like Claude Code and Codex."
          ],
          "zh": [
            "本地编码代理在本地编码环境中运行。",
            "这些代理通常利用开放权重模型。",
            "它们是Claude Code和Codex等专有云端订阅服务的替代方案。"
          ]
        },
        "impact": {
          "en": "This development suggests a potential shift in the adoption of AI coding tools, offering developers alternatives to proprietary cloud services and potentially fostering innovation with open-weight models.",
          "zh": "这一发展预示着AI编码工具采用的潜在转变，为开发者提供了专有云服务的替代方案，并可能促进开放权重模型的创新。"
        },
        "source": "Ahead of AI",
